{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/mysql/02_batch/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<p>테이블을 만드는 방법은 직접 SQL문(create table)을 치는 방법과 파일로 저장해서 관리하는 방법 2가지가 있다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-sql문create-table을-이용한-방법\" style=\"position:relative;\">1. SQL문(create table)을 이용한 방법<a href=\"#1-sql%EB%AC%B8create-table%EC%9D%84-%EC%9D%B4%EC%9A%A9%ED%95%9C-%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95\" aria-label=\"1 sql문create table을 이용한 방법 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sql\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-sql line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-sql\"><span class=\"token keyword\">create</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">table</span> friend2<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\r\n  num <span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">not</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">null</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>    \r\n  name <span class=\"token keyword\">char</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  address <span class=\"token keyword\">char</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">80</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  tel <span class=\"token keyword\">char</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">20</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">primary</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">key</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>num<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  \r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"2-파일로-저장해-관리하는-방법-sql파일\" style=\"position:relative;\">2. 파일로 저장해 관리하는 방법 (sql파일)<a href=\"#2-%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC%EB%A1%9C-%EC%A0%80%EC%9E%A5%ED%95%B4-%EA%B4%80%EB%A6%AC%ED%95%98%EB%8A%94-%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95-sql%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC\" aria-label=\"2 파일로 저장해 관리하는 방법 sql파일 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>파일생성</p>\n<p>특정 디렉토리에 저장</p>\n<p>Shell에서 폴더로 이동</p>\n<p>일괄실행 명령어 실행</p>\n<ol>\n<li>텍스트 파일에 데이터베이스 테이블 생성 명령 저장</li>\n<li>bini 폴더로 이동</li>\n<li>SQL 명령 일괄 실행 및 실행 확인</li>\n</ol>\n<p>c: 드라이버에 [bini] 폴더를 만든다. 메모장에 아래와 같이 입력후 bini폴더에 friend2.sql로 저장한다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-파일생성\" style=\"position:relative;\">1. 파일생성<a href=\"#1-%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC%EC%83%9D%EC%84%B1\" aria-label=\"1 파일생성 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>friend2.sql 파일</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sql\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-sql line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-sql\"><span class=\"token keyword\">create</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">table</span> friend2<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\r\nnum <span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">not</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">null</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\nname <span class=\"token keyword\">char</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\naddress <span class=\"token keyword\">char</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">80</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\ntel <span class=\"token keyword\">char</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">20</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">primary</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">key</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>num<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"2-파일-특정-위치에-저장\" style=\"position:relative;\">2. 파일 특정 위치에 저장<a href=\"#2-%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC-%ED%8A%B9%EC%A0%95-%EC%9C%84%EC%B9%98%EC%97%90-%EC%A0%80%EC%9E%A5\" aria-label=\"2 파일 특정 위치에 저장 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<h3 id=\"3-폴더이동-cd명령어\" style=\"position:relative;\">3. 폴더이동 (cd명령어)<a href=\"#3-%ED%8F%B4%EB%8D%94%EC%9D%B4%EB%8F%99-cd%EB%AA%85%EB%A0%B9%EC%96%B4\" aria-label=\"3 폴더이동 cd명령어 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>cd 명령어를 이용해 원하는 폴더로 이동해야 한다.</p>\n<p>cd.. change directory (폴더 이동) 한단계 이동</p>\n<p>cd\\ root  디렉토리로 가라</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 392px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/ecf9f004730e442321513c5cd311dc94/c4bf7/image01.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >